- usr/bin: slacker (cli), slacker-gui and slacker-flatpak
- slacker-flatpak: experimental; runs flatpak as the user, never as root;
  flatpak itself is not part of this package
- etc/slacker: shipped as .new, merged by doinst.sh config()
- var/lib/slacker: trust anchors (GPG pins, quarantine); keep it
- var/cache/slacker: disposable; slacker clean-cache empties packages/
- Installs through pkgtools only; never touches /var/adm by itself
- Repo follows Slackware Linux layout
